<p>Illinois Senate, 8th District, on the Chicago ballot November 3, 2026. Party: Democratic. Incumbent.</p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>His official biography says his focus is income inequality, reducing gun violence, quality education regardless of zip code, and advancing immigrant, LGBTQ, and women&#39;s rights. He has held the seat since 2019 and serves as Senate Majority Caucus Whip.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>Former legislative coordinator for SEIU Healthcare, outreach director for U.S. Rep. Brad Schneider, and past president of the Indo-American Democratic Organization.</p>
